      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Auth \u00b7 Postgres (PostgREST) \u00b7 Storage \u00b7\nRealtime \u00b7 Edge Functions\n\nCall an Edge Function from Swift:\nclient.functions.invoke(\"place-accessibility\",\n  options: .init(body: ...))\n\nOne consistent client for almost the\nentire backend surface.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Auth \u00b7 Postgres (PostgREST) \u00b7 Storage \u00b7\nRealtime \u00b7 Edge Functions\n\nCall an Edge Function from Swift:\nclient.functions.invoke(\"place-accessibility\",\n  options: .init(body: ...))\n\nOne consistent client for almost the\nentire backend surface.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 135
    },
