    {
      "id": "urRSDCuLk9EGznlTfu7o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 816,
      "y": 540.8,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 157,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 679580777,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1578294494,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1755000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "~3B params, multimodal (image + text), FREE, private\nGuided generation via @Generable -> schema-constrained\nstructured output (no malformed JSON, no free-text parsing)\n3 resolution modes per call: rapid (9 tok/img, cheap) /\nbalanced / high-res (for reading signage text)\nMulti-frame reasoning: feed several video frames in ONE call\nTrained to answer 'unclear' instead of hallucinating\n~30 tok/s generation, sub-3s typical for short structured\noutput (iPhone 15 Pro baseline, pre-vision model figure)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "~3B params, multimodal (image + text), FREE, private\nGuided generation via @Generable -> schema-constrained\nstructured output (no malformed JSON, no free-text parsing)\n3 resolution modes per call: rapid (9 tok/img, cheap) /\nbalanced / high-res (for reading signage text)\nMulti-frame reasoning: feed several video frames in ONE call\nTrained to answer 'unclear' instead of hallucinating\n~30 tok/s generation, sub-3s typical for short structured\noutput (iPhone 15 Pro baseline, pre-vision model figure)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 126
    },
