      "updated": 1755000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Edge Function: place-accessibility  \u2014  THE MONEY GATE",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Edge Function: place-accessibility  \u2014  THE MONEY GATE",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "MbJGWwQkN3qdKrGfw7pn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56,
      "y": 910.8,
      "width": 529,
      "height": 243,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 396344601,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1981262397,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1755000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Check place_cache for this place:\n   synthesized result fresh?\n   -> return immediately (skip Apify AND on-device ML)\n2. Only a raw scrape cached (or it's stale)?\n   -> return raw sources to client for on-device synthesis\n3. Nothing cached at all?\n   -> call Apify, write raw scrape to place_cache,\n      return raw sources to client for on-device synthesis\n4. Client runs Foundation Models synthesis on-device ->\n   writes the synthesized nutrition-label back to\n   place_cache so EVERY future user benefits, not just this one\n\nClient NEVER calls Apify directly \u2014 no exposed API keys.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Check place_cache for this place:\n   synthesized result fresh?\n   -> return immediately (skip Apify AND on-device ML)\n2. Only a raw scrape cached (or it's stale)?\n   -> return raw sources to client for on-device synthesis\n3. Nothing cached at all?\n   -> call Apify, write raw scrape to place_cache,\n      return raw sources to client for on-device synthesis\n4. Client runs Foundation Models synthesis on-device ->\n   writes the synthesized nutrition-label back to\n   place_cache so EVERY future user benefits, not just this one\n\nClient NEVER calls Apify directly \u2014 no exposed API keys.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 195
    },
    {
      "id": "9eBYF2m5I9MSgqU0Fl3e",
