      "locked": false,
      "text": "- No auth flow designed yet (blocks Save / Share / Review / Route)\n- Discover Nearby must not call Apify live per request \u2014 needs its own\n  cost design (currently the highest-risk, highest-frequency path)\n- Confirm two distinct cache keys: place-ID cache vs query-hash cache\n- TikTok / Instagram share-extension video import \u2014 confirm in or out\n  of scope for v1 (appears in Story 1 diagram, not on the MoSCoW board)\n- Review aggregation logic (many reviews -> one accessibility score)\n  is undefined\n- Route recording: indoor positioning + submission moderation undefined\n- LoRA fine-tuning of the on-device model on our own accessibility data\n  is a real v2 lever, not a v1 concern (must retrain per OS model version)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- No auth flow designed yet (blocks Save / Share / Review / Route)\n- Discover Nearby must not call Apify live per request \u2014 needs its own\n  cost design (currently the highest-risk, highest-frequency path)\n- Confirm two distinct cache keys: place-ID cache vs query-hash cache\n- TikTok / Instagram share-extension video import \u2014 confirm in or out\n  of scope for v1 (appears in Story 1 diagram, not on the MoSCoW board)\n- Review aggregation logic (many reviews -> one accessibility score)\n  is undefined\n- Route recording: indoor positioning + submission moderation undefined\n- LoRA fine-tuning of the on-device model on our own accessibility data\n  is a real v2 lever, not a v1 concern (must retrain per OS model version)",
